  "adaptation": {
    "semantic": "\"remember\" and **remind** are one verb in some languages. In English, you remember something yourself; someone or something reminds you.",
    "grammar": "\"remember\": with the **-ing** form it is about a memory (*I remember locking the door*); with **to** and the base form it means *not forget* (*remember to lock the door*).",
